    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on darwin1859-ch07-12: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.78";
    dc:description "Modern quantitative genetics and social-evolution data directly establish how sterile-worker traits respond to selection through relatives. Broad taxonomic coverage is imperfect but sufficient to resolve the mechanism.";
