    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate heritability of worker traits through reproductive parents and test whether colony reproductive output increases with those traits. A genetic association transmitted by breeders plus colony-level fitness effects supports family selection.";
