    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.1.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Colony fitness and pedigree data are concentrated in model species.", "Kin and multilevel-selection parameterizations can describe the same process.";
